    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a mouse button released event. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class inherits from the <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_mouse_event" kindref="compound">MouseEvent</ref> base class and is used to represent a specific type of event, which is a mouse button being released. The constructor takes an integer parameter representing the button that was released. The <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_mouse_button_released_event_1ae7e7d5909e8ef69560a24ab7018e8410" kindref="member">ToString()</ref> method overrides the base class&apos;s pure virtual method and returns a string representation of this event.</para>
<para>Represents a mouse button release event.</para>
<para>This class represents a specific type of mouse event where a button is released. It includes details about the button that was released. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
